{"abstract":[],"archived":false,"aiSummary":{"text":["Lenovo Group Ltd. expects to grow revenue to $100 billion this fiscal year, after its first-quarter results beat analyst estimates by a wide margin.","Revenue in the quarter ended June jumped 43% while adjusted profit surged 176% from the same period a year ago, with the company's AI infrastructure business reporting fast growth.","Chief Executive Officer Yang Yuanqing said the strong result came in part because the company accurately anticipated component supply shortages and cost increases and addressed them \"appropriately and successfully\"."],"appliedAt":"2026-08-13T08:39:12.822Z","__typename":"AISummary"},"adTargeting":{"page":"article","__typename":"AdTargeting"},"assistance":null,"attributor":"bn","authoredRegion":"Global","authors":null,"audios":[],"body":{"type":"document","content":[{"type":"inline-newsletter","data":{"position":"top"},"content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"type":"entity","subType":"security","data":{"security":{"identifiers":{"parsekey":"992 HK Equity"}},"link":{"href":"bbg://securities/992%20HK%20Equity","title":"Company Overview","itemscope":"itemscope","itemprop":"StoryLink","tooltip":"Company Overview","destination":{"bbg":"bbg://securities/992%20HK%20Equity"}}},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"Lenovo Group Ltd. "}],"meta":{"type":"SecurityLink","security":"992 HK Equity"}},{"type":"text","value":"expects to grow revenue to $100 billion this fiscal year, boosting its outlook after demand for AI hardware helped its first-quarter results beat analyst estimates by a wide margin. "}]},{"type":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"The company’s shares surged as much as 22% in Hong Kong to a fresh record, extending its gains this year to about 280% and cementing its position as the top performer on the "},{"type":"entity","subType":"security","data":{"security":{"identifiers":{"parsekey":"HSCEI Index"}},"link":{"href":"bbg://securities/HSCEI%20Index","title":"Company Overview","itemscope":"itemscope","itemprop":"StoryLink","tooltip":"Company Overview","destination":{"bbg":"bbg://securities/HSCEI%20Index"}}},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"Hang Seng China Enterprise Index"}],"meta":{"security":"HSCEI Index","type":"SecurityLink"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"Revenue in the quarter ended June jumped 43% while adjusted profit surged 176% from the same period a year ago. Lenovo delivered resilient sales growth in its laptop, smartphone and tablets despite the ongoing memory crunch hitting consumer electronics. Its AI infrastructure business continues to report fast growth, with revenue nearly doubling and solid profit growth sending its operating margin to an all-time high of 9.1%. "}]},{"type":"ad","data":{"num":1,"pageId":"article"},"content":[]},{"type":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"“Earlier this year we set a goal to reach $100 billion revenue within two years but given the strong momentum we have demonstrated in the first quarter I’m confident we are ahead of the schedule,” Chief Executive Officer "},{"type":"entity","subType":"person","data":{"person":{"identifiers":{"personId":1798340}},"link":{"href":"bbg://people/profile/1798340","title":"Bloomberg Profile","itemscope":"itemscope","itemprop":"StoryLink","tooltip":"Bloomberg Profile","destination":{"bbg":"bbg://people/profile/1798340"}}},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"Yang Yuanqing"}],"meta":{"profile":"1798340","type":"ProfileLink"}},{"type":"text","value":" said in an interview on Thursday."}]},{"type":"media","subType":"chart","data":{"identifiers":{"avmmId":464099351},"remoteContent":[{"link":{"destination":{"bbg":"http://resource.bloomberg.com/images/464099351","web":"https://www.bloomberg.com/toaster/v2/charts/88pglanyhdp7slx4oxh3sfb5xiem128k"}},"rendition":"highres"}],"chart":{"data-id":"464099351","data-type":"image","data-image-type":"chart","data-image-size":"full","data-align":"center","id":464099351,"type":"image","imageType":"chart","imageSize":"full","align":"center","src":"https://www.bloomberg.com/toaster/v2/charts/88pglanyhdp7slx4oxh3sfb5xiem128k","alt":"","caption":"","credit":"","fallback":"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/id4hE0LWNF18/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png"},"attachment":{"id":"464099351","title":"Lenovo's AI-Fueled Share Rally Tops HSCEI","subtitle":"Change since Dec. 31, 2025","uuid":"88pglanyhdp7slx4oxh3sfb5xiem128k","url":"https://www.bloomberg.com/toaster/v2/charts/88pglanyhdp7slx4oxh3sfb5xiem128k","footnote":"","source":"Source: Bloomberg","theme":"business","aspectRatio":"2010:1392","creator":"TOASTER","responsiveImages":{"light":{"canvasWidth":null,"height":1392,"id":null,"url":"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/id4hE0LWNF18/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png","width":2010,"__typename":"ChartResponsiveImage"},"default":{"canvasWidth":null,"height":1392,"id":null,"url":"https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/id4hE0LWNF18/v3/-1x-1.png","width":2010,"__typename":"ChartResponsiveImage"},"large":null,"mobile":null,"widget":null,"__typename":"ChartResponsiveImageSet"},"__typename":"Chart"}}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"The market has sharply rerated Lenovo this year, increasingly looking past its legacy PC roots and valuing the company as an artificial intelligence infrastructure play as surging data-center investment drives demand for its servers. That shift has powered a standout rally in the shares on expectations that AI servers will continue to be an earnings engine for the company."}]},{"type":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"type":"text","value":"The results “delivered a strong broad-based beat, reinforcing the structural AI-driven growth narrative,” Citigroup Inc. analysts including "},{"type":"entity","subType":"person","data":{"person":{"identifie